meta {
  name: 11_OrgCodeFilter
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  Scenario: The org code filter is limited to the org code the caller owns

    When a service owner filters on its own org code
    Then the request succeeds
    When it filters on an org code belonging to another service owner
    Then the request is rejected
    When the same filter is used with the admin scope
    Then it is allowed, since the admin scope may ask on behalf of any org code

  The filter narrows the list to parties where the subject has access to a resource owned by
  that service owner.
}
